=2 Notes
You must enter the Mog Garden on 10 separate Earth days before you can commence this quest. Having 10 Shining Stars is not enough - even if you get extra Shining Stars from a Campaign, you still must enter the Mog Garden on 10 separate days. You can see how many days you've visited the Mog Garden by speaking to your Green Thumb Moogle, asking to "Learn about the Mog Garden" and selecting "Tidbits of information."
=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to your {n:Green Thumb Moogle} to start the quest.
* Check your **Flotsam** to obtain a {@k} {k:Glass pendulum}.
* Talk to your {n:Green Thumb Moogle} to complete the quest and receive a {@i:Grow-M-Good|4011} {i:Flask of Grow-M-Good|Flask of Grow-M-Good|4011}

